  "description": "MCPInvoke is a lightweight .NET library that provides an execution endpoint for Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools. It works in conjunction with MCPBuckle (for discovery) to enable AI agent interaction with your ASP.NET Core APIs. Version 1.0.1 adds integrated ASP.NET Core controller support to easily expose your API controllers as MCP tools.",
